<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cultus sells assets to Santos.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cultus sells assets to Santos.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Junior oil and gas producer Cultus Petroleum NL said on Monday it had sold its interest in a number of non-core assets to Santos Ltd for about A$12 million.</p>
<p>Cultus said Santos had agreed to buy a 9.38 percent interest in Petroleum Lease OL-3 and the Palm Valley gas production facilities, and a 1.76 percent interest in the Dingo Retention Lease RL-2.</p>
<p>Both OL-3 and RL-2 are situated in the Amadeus Basin in the Northern Territory.</p>
</text>
